      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Audio Mixer \uC758 BGM \uADF8\uB8F9 \u2192 Add Effect \u2192 <b>Lowpass</b>\n2. Snapshots \uC758 + \uB85C <b>Normal</b>, <b>Paused</b> \uB450 \uAC1C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uAE30\n3. Paused \uC120\uD0DD \uC0C1\uD0DC\uC5D0\uC11C Lowpass Cutoff 800Hz, Volume -4dB\n   (Normal \uC740 22000Hz, 0dB)\n4. \uCF54\uB4DC:\n<color=#9FD0FF>[SerializeField] AudioMixerSnapshot normal, paused;\nvoid Pause(bool on) {\n  Time.timeScale = on ? 0 : 1;\n  (on ? paused : normal).TransitionTo(0.4f);\n}</color>\n   (Audio Mixer Update Mode \uB97C Unscaled Time \uC73C\uB85C)\n\n<color=#9BE89B>\uC774 \uC52C</color>: AudioLowPassFilter + \uC2A4\uB0C5\uC0F7 \uAC12 \uBCF4\uAC04\uC73C\uB85C \uAC19\uC740 \uD6A8\uACFC"
